# The upstream DSP this plugin hosts. None of it is in this repo: tools/fetch-upstream.sh clones these exact commits into
# build/upstream/ at build time (git checks each commit by its hash; GxPlugins' superproject commit pins every pedal's
# submodule commit too). The Upstream workflow (tools/upstream-check.sh) opens a pull request that moves them forward.
